            "sid": "MAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ kuma syũa yauma o na kũvika yathũa syĩtwa yakwa yĩthĩwaa ĩnene katĩ wa Andũ‐ma‐mbaĩ‐ingĩ; na kĩla vandũ ũvani na nthembo ntheu nithembeawa syĩtwa yakwa: nũndũ syĩtwa yakwa yĩthĩwaa ĩnene katĩ wa Andũ‐ma‐mbaĩ‐ingĩ, easya ũu Yeova wa nguthu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
